    {
      "path": "styles.css",
      "content": "/* Pixel Loan Calculator – styles */\n:root {\n  --bg: #1a1c2c;\n  --card-bg: #2a2d3e;\n  --text: #e0e0e0;\n  --accent: #f4a261;\n  --accent-hover: #e76f51;\n  --border: #4a4e69;\n  --error: #e63946;\n  --font: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  font-family: var(--font);\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: var(--card-bg);\n  border: 4px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  padding: 32px 24px;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 480px;\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n}\n\nh1 {\n  margin: 0 0 24px;\n  font-size: 1.75rem;\n  text-align: center;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.field {\n  margin-bottom: 20px;\n}\n\nlabel {\n  display: block;\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n}\n\ninput {\n  width: 100%;\n  padding: 12px;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  font-family: var(--font);\n  background: var(--bg);\n  border: 3px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  transition: border-color 0.15s, box-shadow 0.15s;\n}\n\ninput:focus {\n  outline: none;\n  border-color: var(--accent);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(244, 162, 97, 0.3);\n}\n\nbutton {\n  width: 100%;\n  padding: 14px;\n  font-size: 1.125rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  font-family: var(--font);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: var(--bg);\n  border: 3px solid var(--accent);\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background 0.15s, transform 0.05s, box-shadow 0.15s;\n  box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n  background: var(--accent-hover);\n  border-color: var(--accent-hover);\n}\n\nbutton:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--text);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\nbutton:active {\n  transform: translate(2px, 2px);\n  box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n}\n\n.results {\n  margin-top: 28px;\n  padding-top: 20px;\n  border-top: 3px dashed var(--border);\n}\n\n.result-row {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: baseline;\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\n  font-size: 1.125rem;\n}\n\n.result-row .label {\n  font-weight: 500;\n  color: var(--text);\n}\n\n.result-row .value {\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n}\n\n.error {\n  margin-top: 16px;\n  color: var(--error);\n  font-weight: 600;\n  min-height: 1.5em;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .card {\n    padding: 24px 16px;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 1.4rem;\n  }\n  .result-row {\n    font-size: 1rem;\n  }\n}\n",
      "description": "Pixel-themed styling for the calculator."
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "// Pixel Loan Calculator\n(function() {\n  'use strict';\n\n  const form = document.getElementById('loan-form');\n  const amountInput = document.getElementById('amount');\n  const rateInput = document.getElementById('rate');\n  const yearsInput = document.getElementById('years');\n  const monthlyEl = document.getElementById('monthly');\n  const totalPaidEl = document.getElementById('total-paid');\n  const totalInterestEl = document.getElementById('total-interest');\n  const errorEl = document.getElementById('error-msg');\n\n  function formatCurrency(value) {\n    return '$' + value.toFixed(2);\n  }\n\n  function calculate() {\n    errorEl.textContent = '';\n    monthlyEl.textContent = '—';\n    totalPaidEl.textContent = '—';\n    totalInterestEl.textContent = '—';\n\n    const amount = parseFloat(amountInput.value);\n    const annualRate = parseFloat(rateInput.value);\n    const years = parseFloat(yearsInput.value);\n\n    if (isNaN(amount) || isNaN(annualRate) || isNaN(years)) {\n      errorEl.textContent = 'Please enter valid numbers.';\n      return;\n    }\n    if (amount <= 0 || annualRate < 0 || years <= 0) {\n      errorEl.textContent = 'Amount and years must be positive; rate cannot be negative.';\n      return;\n    }\n\n    const monthlyRate = annualRate / 100 / 12;\n    const totalMonths = years * 12;\n\n    let monthlyPayment;\n    if (monthlyRate === 0) {\n      monthlyPayment = amount / totalMonths;\n    } else {\n      const factor = Math.pow(1 + monthlyRate, totalMonths);\n      monthlyPayment = amount * monthlyRate * factor / (factor - 1);\n    }\n\n    const totalPaid = monthlyPayment * totalMonths;\n    const totalInterest = totalPaid - amount;\n\n    monthlyEl.textContent = formatCurrency(monthlyPayment);\n    totalPaidEl.textContent = formatCurrency(totalPaid);\n    totalInterestEl.textContent = formatCurrency(totalInterest);\n  }\n\n  form.addEventListener('submit', function(e) {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    calculate();\n  });\n})();\n",
      "description": "Calculation logic and event handling."
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Loan Calculator\n\nA simple offline browser app that calculates monthly loan payments, total paid, and total interest based on loan amount, yearly interest rate, and loan term in years.\n\n## Features\n\n- Pixel-themed UI with a centered card and cohesive color palette\n- Input fields for loan amount, yearly interest rate (%), and loan term (years)\n- Calculates monthly payment (to two decimals), total paid, and total interest\n- Handles zero interest rate and validates inputs\n- Keyboard accessible with labeled controls and visible focus states\n- Responsive layout from 360px wide\n\n## Usage\n\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser. Enter the loan details and click **Calculate**.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` – main page structure\n- `styles.css` – pixel-themed styling\n- `script.js` – calculation logic\n\n## Constraints\n\n- Offline only: no external assets, packages, or network requests\n- Plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript\n- Relative paths and standard file extensions\n\n## Testing\n\nManually tested for:\n- Correct calculations with various inputs (including zero interest)\n- Input validation and error messages\n- Keyboard navigation and focus indicators\n- Responsive layout at 360px width\n",
      "description": "Project documentation."
    }
